routing.creatorkit-graphic-director:
# AGENTS

When a piece is becoming a video:
  @Thumbnail Designer, please set the cover and the title before anything is scripted.
When a script needs a still for the feed:
  @Short Video Scripter, please tell me which frame carries the idea.

routing.creatorkit-short-video-scripter:
# AGENTS

When the script cannot honestly deliver what the cover promises:
  @Thumbnail Designer, please change the cover rather than letting me overstate the video.
When a key frame should also exist as a still for the feed:
  @Graphic Director, please brief it.

routing.creatorkit-thumbnail-designer:
# AGENTS

When the cover and the title are chosen:
  @Short Video Scripter, please write to the promise they make.
When a cover concept needs a laid-out graphic instead of an illustration:
  @Graphic Director, please take the format decision.
